  HS/Link File Transfer Protocol
  ======================================
  Clean-room Pascal implementation
  Mystic BBS IRC Fork — GPLv3

  Bidirectional send+receive
  24-bit CRC error detection
  Sliding window flow control
  Crash recovery / resume
  Ready packet negotiation
  Chat during transfer
  16 packet types, all handled

  1,067 lines | Pure Pascal
  Compiles: Linux, Win32, DOS, FreeBSD

  From HDK spec — no C code copied
  Original protocol: Samuel H. Smith

  m_protocol_hslink.pas
  July 2026
